docs/plans/2026-06-17-003-fix-twofield-compliant-density-projection-plan.md:111:- `src/solvers/twofield/pressure.wgsl` — `cell_classify` over-density half: on `dbg.w`, `s_target = dbg.x·max(e − DEADBAND, 0)/dt` (rate `e/dt`, no `DENSITY_RELAX` cap) instead of `…/(DENSITY_RELAX·dt)`; the legacy `else` is unchanged.
