docs/plans/2026-06-18-001-feat-twofield-surface-weighted-dissipation-plan.md:143:**In scope:** the surface-weighted velocity-averaging dissipation in `g2p_water` (the XSPH-on-grid mechanism), its Params/Config plumbing, the supporting splash-path clamp relaxation with FP-safety, and the gates/perf/render validation — all on the two-field solver.
