docs/plans/2026-06-15-001-fix-wet-sand-crater-stirring-plan.md:86:**Approach:** The global blend scales the G2P affine C by `1 − pic_blend` (the existing knob); no φ_f gating, no new binding. Choose the smallest value that quiets the pool to the target (≈0.05 measured: settled tail KE 67→21, max|v| 0.95→0.52). Keep the `dbg.x` relief gate and `RELIEF_DEADBAND` plumbing as-is (inert).
