   179	/// Window statistics over the SETTLED tail [tail_start, end): the late-window mean KE and the
   180	/// peak KE. A correct settled pool has its KE decay early and stay low — so the tail peak must
   181	/// not exceed the tail mean by a large factor (no spontaneous re-energization spikes).
   182	fn tail_stats(ke: &[f64], tail_start: usize) -> (f64, f64) {
